  "content": "<p>\n  在手持時，將<strong>不死图腾</strong>顯示為<strong>動畫河豚桶</strong>，由 Punchy 和 Refined Buckets 驅動。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0b566fb8def522cb658008a9a49539e9c16678c3_0.webp\"\n       width=\"420\"\n       alt=\"手持時，河豚桶取代不死图腾\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/lqNBiv3L/images/5d2f2d918a9f0193a9c74b6eaa07606227392e95.gif\"\n       width=\"420\"\n       alt=\"展示不死图腾在手持時轉變為動畫河豚桶的動畫演示\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><em>動畫演示：物品欄中的原版图腾，手持時的動畫河豚桶</em></p>\n\n<h3 align=\"center\">🔗 需求</h3>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/refined-buckets\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7f5746baecfba25285f8dfeff3f34dedc36b6126.png\"\n         width=\"250\"\n         alt=\"需要 Refined Buckets 資源包\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/punchy-fpa\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a26a935a6ed3ee2417064b478f4ff2148be78485.png\"\n         width=\"250\"\n         alt=\"需要 Punchy 模組\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n### ⚙️ 安裝\n\n1. 安裝 **Refined Buckets** 和 **Punchy**\n2. 將此資源包放置在 **Refined Buckets 之上**\n\n**故障排除**\n- 如果手持物品的對齊方式錯誤或行為異常，請嘗試在 Punchy 設置中禁用 *物品物理效果 (Item Physics)*\n\n### 📜 致謝\n\n- Refined Buckets：提供模型與動畫  \n- Punchy：提供物品動畫系統",
